  "23308347": {
    "created": "2026-10-12T03:51:04.733005+00:00",
    "modified": "2026-10-12T03:51:04.986430+00:00",
    "id": 23308347,
    "conceptrecid": "23308346",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23308347",
    "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23308346",
    "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23308347",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "Confirmatory evaluation of SRDF v2 (tie-break + balanced-accuracy utility) on an independent cohort",
      "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23308347",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-12",
      "description": "<p>Study ID: NC-S06-CONFIRM</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Repository: https://github.com/mohammedqaidalathwary/neurocortex-srdf</p>\n<p>Frozen commit: 41570895c2c3fce5334e69eb5dab9895b9e42c94</p>\n<p>Protocol SHA-256: 32bb9acd810b4f4567f4b799a0230ddd50946770631f2f9fd1192f2c11c16759</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Background:</p>\n<p>SRDF is a runtime framework for controlled structural adaptation. v2 of the framework (S06a+d) modified the Arbiter tie-break rule and replaced accuracy with balanced accuracy inside the utility signal. v2 was derived AFTER inspecting failures of v1 on the 45 S04 datasets; its effect on those datasets is therefore exploratory and optimistic by construction. This protocol specifies a confirmatory evaluation on a fully independent cohort.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hypotheses:</p>\n<p>H1: v2 improves on v1.</p>\n<p>H2: v2 is non-inferior to Always-SMOTE+RF (governance does not cost accuracy), margin 0.005.</p>\n<p>H3: v2 improves on the RF baseline (replication of S04, reported separately outside the Holm family).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Decision rules:</p>\n<p>- SESOI = 0.01.</p>\n<p>- Alpha family = 0.05.</p>\n<p>- Multiplicity: Holm-Bonferroni over {H1, H2}.</p>\n<p>- Failed hypothesis reported as a null finding; no re-run.</p>\n<p>`</p>",
      "access_right": "open",
      "creators": [
        {
          "name": "Al-Athwary, Mohammed Qaid",
          "affiliation": "Independent Researcher",
          "orcid": "0009-0006-9075-072X"
        }
      ],
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "language": "aig",
      "resource_type": {
        "title": "Preprint",
        "type": "publication",
        "subtype": "preprint"
      },
      "license": {
        "id": "cc-by-4.0"
      },
