      "title": "S07 Results \u2014 Post-registration Deposit",
      "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23406120",
      "publication_date": "2026-10-16",
      "description": "<p>Complete S07 output. This deposit contains all results, analyses, and forensic audit records of the S07 study on benchmark-practice inflation.</p>\n<p>Contents:<br>- Locked protocol (SHA-256: c78b78ed48ea3e00d1e1c9f63ace246485fff8657164061aded5fdeb8febd525)<br>- 131-dataset cohort manifest<br>- Case-level results for 7 confirmatory arms (A1&ndash;A7) across 98 datasets, 10 splits each<br>- 7 confirmatory tests with Holm correction (H1, H2&times;3, H4&times;3)<br>- H3 win-flip descriptive analysis<br>- Moderator HC3 OLS regression<br>- Sensitivity analyses (Wilcoxon, trimmed means)<br>- Arm L (Logistic Regression) &mdash; exploratory<br>- Arm B (SRDF threshold re-reading on S04 and S06 cohorts) &mdash; interpretive<br>- Forensic audit: 12 tests, all PASS<br>- Merkle root: a332c6b281737079ad3f00e78083efd8195e1a9e5409d1bd1b5f9af741c4e2a6</p>\n<p>Key findings:<br>- H1 SUPPORTED: threshold inflation = +9.76 bAcc (CI95 [8.24, 11.32], p &lt; 1e-4)<br>- H2_CSRF INFERIOR: &minus;10.71 bAcc<br>- H2_EE EQUIVALENT: +0.74 bAcc<br>- H4_* EQUIVALENT (AUC): the effect disappears under a threshold-free metric<br>- Scenario A of the pre-registered plan achieved<br>- All 12 forensic validation tests passed</p>\n<p>Pre-registration DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23404802</p>",
